<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble falls to 14,700 to dlr in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble falls to 14,700 to dlr in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble slipped to 14,700 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from  14,650 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    October 1	     September 30</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    14,650		  14,650</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $2.970 million	    $5.037 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
